{"additionalPlain":"At Hey Jane, we work towards the vision of having equitable healthcare, changing the status quo, and rebuilding the way people experience healthcare—and bring that same vision to our workplace. We’re an equal opportunity employer committed to building an inclusive environment, and encourage all applicants from every background and life experience.\n","additional":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px\">At Hey Jane, we work towards the vision of having equitable healthcare, changing the status quo, and rebuilding the way people experience healthcare—and bring that same vision to our workplace. We’re an equal opportunity employer committed to building an inclusive environment, and encourage all applicants from every background and life experience.</span></div>","categories":{"commitment":"Part Time","department":"Clinical","location":"Remote","team":"Clinical","allLocations":["Remote"]},"createdAt":1782225873652,"descriptionPlain":"Unless otherwise noted, all positions are fully remote with work permitted from the following states: CA, CO, IL, MA, MD, NJ, NY, OR, and WA.\n\nWe are living through a pivotal moment for reproductive and sexual health—and Hey Jane is uniquely positioned to help.\n\nFrom day one, we've been committed to providing safe, discreet medication abortion treatment—and have helped more than 100,000 people get the care they need. Today, we offer a range of reproductive and sexual health care services from the comfort and convenience of your phone.  Our in-house clinical care team, composed of board certified doctors, advanced practice clinicians, nurses, and patient care advocates, is just a text message away. We’re committed to helping our patients get safe, discreet, judgment-free virtual health care, from a team that truly cares.\n\n\nThe team at Hey Jane is looking to expand our team by adding a detail oriented, human-centered, tech-savvy Patient Care Advocate with a background in medication abortion who can provide excellent customer service on a full-time basis.\n \nThis is a remote role with required weekend hours. We are currently hiring for 2 part time roles.\n \nSchedule: 09:00am–07:00pm PT (10 hr shifts)\n \nWorkdays: One of the following schedules:\nTuesday and Sunday\nMonday and Sunday\nCompensation: $30-$33/hr (higher rate for weekend differential pay)\n","description":"<div><i>Unless otherwise noted, all positions are fully remote with work permitted from the following states:&nbsp;</i><i style=\"font-size: small\">CA, CO, IL, MA, MD, NJ, NY, OR, and WA.</i></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt\">We are living through a pivotal moment for reproductive and sexual health—and Hey Jane is uniquely positioned to help.</span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt\">From day one, we've been committed to providing safe, discreet medication abortion treatment—and have helped more than </span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">100,000</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"> people get the care they need. Today, we offer a range of reproductive and sexual health care services from the comfort and convenience of your phone.&nbsp;&nbsp;Our in-house clinical care team, composed of board certified doctors, advanced practice clinicians, nurses, and patient care advocates, is just a text message away. We’re committed to helping our patients get safe, discreet, judgment-free virtual health care, from a team that truly cares.</span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt;\">The team at Hey Jane is looking to expand our team by adding a detail oriented, human-centered, tech-savvy Patient Care Advocate with a background in medication abortion who can provide excellent customer service on a full-time basis.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt;\">This is a remote role with required weekend hours. We are currently hiring for 2 part time roles.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http://needs.Schedule\" style=\"color: #000000;\" class=\"postings-link\"><strong style=\"font-size: 9.5pt;\">Schedule</strong></a><strong style=\"font-size: 9.5pt;\">: </strong><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt;\">09:00am–07:00pm PT (10 hr shifts)</span></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http://coverage.Workdays\" style=\"color: #000000;\" class=\"postings-link\"><strong style=\"font-size: 9.5pt;\">Workdays</strong></a><strong style=\"font-size: 9.5pt;\">: </strong><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt;\">One of the following schedules:</span></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li>Tuesday and Sunday</li>\n<li>Monday and Sunday</li>\n</ul>\n<div><u><strong><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt;\">Compensation:</span></strong></u><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt;\"> $30-$33/hr (higher rate for weekend differential pay)</span></div>","id":"42de8b83-b5e8-4b73-9231-1a128257821b","lists":[{"text":"Responsibilities","content":"\n<li>Answering patient questions related to treatment, logistics, and next steps</li>\n<li>Troubleshooting patient concerns related to shipping, refunds, scheduling, and care coordination</li>\n<li>Tracking patients through their care journey and ensuring timely follow-up</li>\n<li>Checking, documenting, and reporting insurance eligibility information</li>\n<li>Maintaining accurate documentation within the EMR while adhering to HIPAA and privacy standards</li>\n<li>Balancing multiple priorities while staying grounded, communicative, and reliable to both patients and teammates</li>\n<li>This role requires a high level of accuracy and follow-through. Small details directly impact patient care. We value team members who take pride in getting things right, asking clarifying questions, and closing loops.</li>\n"},{"text":"Qualifications","content":"\n<li>Healthcare background (MA, PCA, CNA, or similar clinical or patient-facing role)&nbsp; with 1+ years of experience in abortion care</li>\n<li>Comfort working across both in-clinic and remote environments</li>\n<li>Strong communication, organization, and problem-solving skills</li>\n<li>Strong triage skills, with the ability to make sound decisions in real time</li>\n<li>Exceptional communication skills, with the ability to deliver clear, empathetic guidance to patients in moments of stress or uncertainty</li>\n<li>Skilled at using online tools and technology to deliver care and communicate with patients</li>\n<li>Comfort in supporting patients with sensitive health issues, such as abortion and birth control</li>\n<li>&nbsp;Ability to navigate protocols, regulatory requirements, and organizational policies related to patient care and documentation</li>\n<li>Experience providing trauma-informed care, demonstrated through the ability to slow down, adjust tone, and meet patients with steadiness and respect during moments of crisis</li>\n<li>Eager to engage in constant process improvement to help refine tools and operations for improved care delivery</li>\n<li>Strong ability to prioritize competing tasks, manage time thoughtfully, and communicate proactively with teammates about progress, changes, and follow-through</li>\n"},{"text":"Bonus Points","content":"\n<li>Spanish language proficiency</li>\n<li>Prior remote or hybrid work experience</li>\n<li>Experience working in a startup or fast-growing organization</li>\n"}],"salaryRange":{"min":30,"max":33,"currency":"USD","interval":"per-hour-wage"},"salaryDescription":"<div><u><strong><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt;\">Compensation:</span></strong></u><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt;\"> $30-$33/hr (higher rate for weekend differential pay)</span></div>","salaryDescriptionPlain":"Compensation: $30-$33/hr (higher rate for weekend differential pay)\n","text":"Patient Care Advocate (Part-time)","country":"US","workplaceType":"remote","opening":"<div><i>Unless otherwise noted, all positions are fully remote with work permitted from the following states:&nbsp;</i><i style=\"font-size: small\">CA, CO, IL, MA, MD, NJ, NY, OR, and WA.</i></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt\">We are living through a pivotal moment for reproductive and sexual health—and Hey Jane is uniquely positioned to help.</span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt\">From day one, we've been committed to providing safe, discreet medication abortion treatment—and have helped more than </span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">100,000</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"> people get the care they need. Today, we offer a range of reproductive and sexual health care services from the comfort and convenience of your phone.&nbsp;&nbsp;Our in-house clinical care team, composed of board certified doctors, advanced practice clinicians, nurses, and patient care advocates, is just a text message away. We’re committed to helping our patients get safe, discreet, judgment-free virtual health care, from a team that truly cares.</span></div>","openingPlain":"Unless otherwise noted, all positions are fully remote with work permitted from the following states: CA, CO, IL, MA, MD, NJ, NY, OR, and WA.\n\nWe are living through a pivotal moment for reproductive and sexual health—and Hey Jane is uniquely positioned to help.\n\nFrom day one, we've been committed to providing safe, discreet medication abortion treatment—and have helped more than 100,000 people get the care they need. Today, we offer a range of reproductive and sexual health care services from the comfort and convenience of your phone.  Our in-house clinical care team, composed of board certified doctors, advanced practice clinicians, nurses, and patient care advocates, is just a text message away. We’re committed to helping our patients get safe, discreet, judgment-free virtual health care, from a team that truly cares.\n","descriptionBody":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt;\">The team at Hey Jane is looking to expand our team by adding a detail oriented, human-centered, tech-savvy Patient Care Advocate with a background in medication abortion who can provide excellent customer service on a full-time basis.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt;\">This is a remote role with required weekend hours. We are currently hiring for 2 part time roles.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><a class=\"postings-link\" style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"http://needs.Schedule\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong style=\"font-size: 9.5pt;\">Schedule</strong></a><strong style=\"font-size: 9.5pt;\">: </strong><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt;\">09:00am&ndash;07:00pm PT (10 hr shifts)</span></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><a class=\"postings-link\" style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"http://coverage.Workdays\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong style=\"font-size: 9.5pt;\">Workdays</strong></a><strong style=\"font-size: 9.5pt;\">: </strong><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt;\">One of the following schedules:</span></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li>Tuesday and Sunday</li>\n<li>Monday and Sunday</li>\n</ul>\n<div><u><strong><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt;\">Compensation:</span></strong></u><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt;\"> $30-$33/hr (higher rate for weekend differential pay)</span></div>","descriptionBodyPlain":"The team at Hey Jane is looking to expand our team by adding a detail oriented, human-centered, tech-savvy Patient Care Advocate with a background in medication abortion who can provide excellent customer service on a full-time basis.\n \nThis is a remote role with required weekend hours. We are currently hiring for 2 part time roles.\n \nSchedule: 09:00am–07:00pm PT (10 hr shifts)\n \nWorkdays: One of the following schedules:\nTuesday and Sunday\nMonday and Sunday\nCompensation: $30-$33/hr (higher rate for weekend differential pay)\n","hostedUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/heyjane/42de8b83-b5e8-4b73-9231-1a128257821b","applyUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/heyjane/42de8b83-b5e8-4b73-9231-1a128257821b/apply"}